Intricacy
=========

A competitive level-design puzzler.

Dependencies:
    sdl
    sdl-ttf
    sdl-gfx

To compile the game on *nix:
    Install ghc, cabal, and development packages for the dependencies above,
    then run
	cabal update && cabal install
    which should result in various haskell packages being compiled and
    installed, probably in ~/.cabal/ . The game can then be run as
	~/.cabal/bin/intricacy 
    . Running cabal install as root should install it somewhere global.

To compile the server:
    Perform the steps above, and then run:
	cabal configure -f Server && cabal install
    The server will be installed in
	~/.cabal/bin/intricacy-server
    . The server runs on port 27001 by default. It writes the game database to
    a directory 'intricacydb' under the directory from which it is run.

To compile a curses-only build:
    cabal configure -f -SDL && cabal install

To compile for windows:
    This should work as above once you have the SDL dependencies installed
    properly. Good luck with that.
